@Praetura.LoanService.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5192

### 1. Submit a valid application (the example from the brief).
### Expect 201 Created, status "Pending", and a Location header pointing at the new application.
# @name createApplication
POST {{Praetura.LoanService.API_HostAddress}}/loan-applications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Alice Example",
  "email": "alice@example.com",
  "monthlyIncome": 3500,
  "requestedAmount": 8000,
  "termMonths": 36
}

### 2. Fetch the application created above.
### Right after step 1 it is "Pending" with an empty decisionLog. Within the processing interval (60 seconds by default)
### it becomes "Approved" with three decisionLog entries and a reviewedAt time.
@applicationId = {{createApplication.response.body.$.id}}

GET {{Praetura.LoanService.API_HostAddress}}/loan-applications/{{applicationId}}
Accept: application/json

### 3. An application that is valid input but fails the eligibility rules.
### Accepted with 201 (term of 6 is not "invalid data"); the background job later sets it to "Rejected".
POST {{Praetura.LoanService.API_HostAddress}}/loan-applications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Bob Example",
  "email": "bob@example.com",
  "monthlyIncome": 1500,
  "requestedAmount": 9000,
  "termMonths": 6
}

### 4. Unknown application id. Expect 404 Not Found.
GET {{Praetura.LoanService.API_HostAddress}}/loan-applications/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Accept: application/json

### 5. Not a valid GUID. Expect 404 Not Found (the route does not match).
GET {{Praetura.LoanService.API_HostAddress}}/loan-applications/not-a-guid
Accept: application/json

### 6. Negative amount. Expect 400 Bad Request with a field-level error for requestedAmount.
POST {{Praetura.LoanService.API_HostAddress}}/loan-applications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Carol Example",
  "email": "carol@example.com",
  "monthlyIncome": 3500,
  "requestedAmount": -100,
  "termMonths": 36
}

### 7. Malformed email. Expect 400 Bad Request with an error for email.
POST {{Praetura.LoanService.API_HostAddress}}/loan-applications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Dave Example",
  "email": "not-an-email",
  "monthlyIncome": 3500,
  "requestedAmount": 8000,
  "termMonths": 36
}

### 8. Missing and null fields. Expect 400 Bad Request listing every missing field.
POST {{Praetura.LoanService.API_HostAddress}}/loan-applications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": null,
  "email": "eve@example.com"
}

### 9. Empty JSON object. Expect 400 Bad Request listing every required field.
POST {{Praetura.LoanService.API_HostAddress}}/loan-applications
Content-Type: application/json

{}

###
